WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:04.961
The ghost hurried down the hallway. Zoom! Roxy flew after it.

2
00:00:04.962 --> 00:00:07.821
"Stop!" Roxy yelled.

3
00:00:07.822 --> 00:00:10.114
The ghost looked back and tripped on a rug.

4
00:00:10.115 --> 00:00:12.284
It fell into a small table.

5
00:00:12.285 --> 00:00:15.694
The table shook, and a flowerpot fell on the ghost's head.

6
00:00:15.695 --> 00:00:21.084
Crack! The ghost stumbled backward and fell down the flight of stairs.

7
00:00:21.085 --> 00:00:25.990
Boom! Crash! It tumbled across the floor and into the wall.

8
00:00:25.991 --> 00:00:30.262
A picture fell off the wall and hit the ghost. Bonk!

9
00:00:30.263 --> 00:00:36.261
The ghost rubbed its head. Roxy rushed down to it.

10
00:00:36.262 --> 00:00:40.339
"Poor guy!" Roxy said. "Are you okay?"

11
00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:44.142
The ghost moved fast. But then—

12
00:00:44.143 --> 00:00:45.981
bam! It ran into another

13
00:00:45.982 --> 00:00:49.804
wall. Roxy grabbed the ghost. "You don't need to run

14
00:00:49.805 --> 00:00:53.385
away." Elvis rushed over to Roxy. "You caught

15
00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:57.419
it!" "Yes," Roxy said. "But I don't think it's a

16
00:00:57.420 --> 00:00:59.637
ghost. Ghosts can move through

17
00:00:59.638 --> 00:01:04.212
walls. This creature keeps bumping into things. It's

18
00:01:04.213 --> 00:01:06.846
clumsy." Elvis held a device toward the

19
00:01:06.847 --> 00:01:08.642
creature. Then he wrote in a

20
00:01:08.643 --> 00:01:14.108
notebook. "I don't know what this creature is," he said. "I'll need to study

21
00:01:14.109 --> 00:01:17.381
it." Roxy looked at the creature. "Can you

22
00:01:17.382 --> 00:01:19.774
talk?" The creature gave her a funny

23
00:01:19.775 --> 00:01:23.021
look. "Where did you come from?" Roxy

24
00:01:23.022 --> 00:01:26.485
asked. The creature pulled her toward the

25
00:01:26.486 --> 00:01:31.010
stairs. "Did you come from up there?" Roxy let the creature lead her.

26
00:01:31.011 --> 00:01:35.406
Elvis looked up from his notebook. "Where are you going?"

27
00:01:35.407 --> 00:01:40.568
"I don't know!" Roxy said.

28
00:01:40.569 --> 00:01:44.982
The creature led her to the top of the stairs.

29
00:01:44.983 --> 00:01:47.495
They went down the hallway and into a room.

30
00:01:47.496 --> 00:01:51.143
Everything was covered in dust and cobwebs.

31
00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:54.989
The creature moved toward one wall.

32
00:01:54.990 --> 00:02:00.026
"That's just a wall," Roxy said. "Where are you going?"

33
00:02:00.027 --> 00:02:04.893
"Nowhere!" Elvis ran into the room and caught the creature with a sack.

34
00:02:04.894 --> 00:02:08.070
The creature moved around wildly, trying to get free.

35
00:02:08.071 --> 00:02:12.252
Elvis tried to hold the sack steady.

36
00:02:12.253 --> 00:02:15.044
He brought the creature downstairs to a small room.

37
00:02:15.045 --> 00:02:20.290
Roxy followed him. "What are you doing, Elvis? You're scaring it."

38
00:02:20.291 --> 00:02:23.778
The creature squealed as Elvis placed it in a box.

39
00:02:23.779 --> 00:02:27.314
"I won't hurt it. I just want to study it for—"

40
00:02:27.315 --> 00:02:30.002
Suddenly the house thumped and shook.

41
00:02:30.003 --> 00:02:33.527
Furniture fell over. Pictures fell from walls.

42
00:02:33.528 --> 00:02:35.498
Roxy peeked out of the room.

43
00:02:35.499 --> 00:02:38.509
The house was filled with creatures!

44
00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:40.394
They ran all over the place.

45
00:02:40.395 --> 00:02:42.041
One creature looked under a rug.

46
00:02:42.042 --> 00:02:45.008
A table tipped over. Crash!

47
00:02:45.009 --> 00:02:50.512
Another creature tried to look behind a bookshelf and knocked it over.

48
00:02:50.513 --> 00:02:54.692
Then a creature opened the front door.

49
00:02:54.693 --> 00:02:56.927
Creatures ran outside.

50
00:02:56.928 --> 00:03:02.890
"Ahh!" People outside screamed.

